function out = plot_ch5r_rmse_proxy_comparison(out4, out5, out_dir, stamp)
%PLOT_CH5R_RMSE_PROXY_COMPARISON
% Plot Fisher-based RMSE proxy comparison using only the complete-window body.
% The head/tail samples outside the full-window valid core are removed.

if nargin < 4 || isempty(stamp)
    stamp = datestr(now, 'yyyymmdd_HHMMSS');
end
if nargin < 3 || isempty(out_dir)
    out_dir = pwd;
end
if ~exist(out_dir, 'dir')
    mkdir(out_dir);
end

[t4, y4] = local_get_rmse_series(out4);
[t5, y5] = local_get_rmse_series(out5);

n = min(numel(t4), numel(t5));
t = t4(1:n);
y4 = y4(1:n);
y5 = y5(1:n);

mask4 = local_get_full_window_body_mask(out4, n);
mask5 = local_get_full_window_body_mask(out5, n);
mask = mask4 & mask5 & isfinite(y4) & isfinite(y5);

idx = find(mask);
if isempty(idx)
    warning('plot_ch5r_rmse_proxy_comparison:noValidBody', ...
        'No full-window body samples found. Falling back to finite intersection.');
    mask = isfinite(y4) & isfinite(y5);
    idx = find(mask);
end

if isempty(idx)
    error('plot_ch5r_rmse_proxy_comparison:noData', ...
        'No finite RMSE proxy samples available for plotting.');
end

i1 = idx(1);
i2 = idx(end);

tb = t(i1:i2);
y4b = y4(i1:i2);
y5b = y5(i1:i2);

fig = figure('Visible', 'off', 'Color', 'w');
plot(tb, y4b, 'LineWidth', 1.8); hold on;
plot(tb, y5b, 'LineWidth', 1.8); hold off;
grid on;

xlabel('Time (s)', 'Interpreter', 'tex');
ylabel('RMSE proxy', 'Interpreter', 'tex');
title(sprintf('R4-real vs R5-real: Fisher-based RMSE proxy (body-only, t=[%d,%d] s)', ...
    round(tb(1)), round(tb(end))), 'Interpreter', 'tex');

legend({'R4-real dynamic pair', 'R5-real predictive pair'}, ...
    'Location', 'best', 'Interpreter', 'tex');

save_path = fullfile(out_dir, ['phaseR5_compare_rmse_proxy_' stamp '.png']);
saveas(fig, save_path);
close(fig);

out = struct();
out.save_path = save_path;
out.t_start = tb(1);
out.t_end = tb(end);
out.i_start = i1;
out.i_end = i2;
out.num_points = numel(tb);
end

function [t, y] = local_get_rmse_series(out)
t = [];
y = [];

% preferred path
if isfield(out, 'result') && isfield(out.result, 'rmse_metrics')
    rm = out.result.rmse_metrics;

    if isfield(rm, 'time_s')
        t = rm.time_s(:);
    elseif isfield(rm, 't_s')
        t = rm.t_s(:);
    elseif isfield(rm, 'time')
        t = rm.time(:);
    end

    if isfield(rm, 'rmse_proxy_timeline')
        y = rm.rmse_proxy_timeline(:);
    elseif isfield(rm, 'rmse_proxy_series')
        y = rm.rmse_proxy_series(:);
    elseif isfield(rm, 'rmse_timeline')
        y = rm.rmse_timeline(:);
    end
end

if isempty(y)
    error('plot_ch5r_rmse_proxy_comparison:missingRMSE', ...
        'Cannot find RMSE proxy timeline in out.result.rmse_metrics.');
end

if isempty(t)
    t = (0:numel(y)-1).';
end

m = min(numel(t), numel(y));
t = t(1:m);
y = y(1:m);
end

function mask = local_get_full_window_body_mask(out, n)
mask = false(n,1);

% 1) strongest preference: explicit valid/full-window mask
cands = {
    {'result','rmse_metrics','valid_mask'}
    {'result','rmse_metrics','full_window_mask'}
    {'result','rmse_metrics','body_mask'}
    {'result','tracking','valid_mask'}
    {'result','tracking','full_window_mask'}
    {'result','state','valid_mask'}
    };

for i = 1:numel(cands)
    v = local_try_get(out, cands{i});
    if ~isempty(v)
        v = logical(v(:));
        m = min(numel(v), n);
        mask(1:m) = v(1:m);
        if any(mask)
            return;
        end
    end
end

% 2) fallback: infer from window parameters
Tw = local_try_get(out, {'cfg','ch5r','window','Tw_s'});
if isempty(Tw)
    Tw = local_try_get(out, {'cfg','window','Tw_s'});
end
if isempty(Tw)
    Tw = local_try_get(out, {'cfg','stage04','Tw_s'});
end
if isempty(Tw)
    Tw = 60;
end

Ts = local_try_get(out, {'cfg','ch5r','sim','Ts_s'});
if isempty(Ts)
    Ts = local_try_get(out, {'cfg','sim','Ts_s'});
end
if isempty(Ts)
    Ts = local_try_get(out, {'cfg','stage02','Ts_s'});
end
if isempty(Ts)
    Ts = 1;
end

half_span = floor((Tw / Ts) / 2);
i1 = 1 + half_span;
i2 = n - half_span;

if i2 >= i1
    mask(i1:i2) = true;
else
    mask(:) = true;
end
end

function v = local_try_get(s, path_cells)
v = [];
cur = s;
for i = 1:numel(path_cells)
    key = path_cells{i};
    if isstruct(cur) && isfield(cur, key)
        cur = cur.(key);
    else
        return;
    end
end
v = cur;
end
